  ('tq-sb-deploying-spring-boot-application-4', 'pt-sb-deploying-spring-boot-application',
   $sb153$app.welcome=Dev is in application.properties. The app starts with the variable APP_WELCOME=Hello set and no profile. What is the value of app.welcome?$sb153$,
   $sb154$["Dev","Hello","APP_WELCOME","null"]$sb154$::jsonb,
